      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T15:40:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack.  I assume (?) it will be okay if a (public) `SkCodec::getHdrStuff()` returns a (private) `SkHdrMetadata`?  (If not, then can you sketch out how `blink::SkiaImageDecoderBase` would get the HDR metadata?)",
