      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T17:10:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it\u0027s Chromium only, we tend to put that in https://github.com/google/skia/tree/main/include/private/chromium\n\nIf Chromium and Android, I suppose this is fine.\n\nI\u0027m not too worried about SkCodec::getHdrStuff() returning a private type as long as we can forward declare it.",
      "parentUuid": "416b2637_b80a31be",
