      "writtenOn": "2025-09-12T09:58:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there\u0027s also an open question of \"where should gainmap and HDR metadata shaders and metadata go in the long term\". I think codecs may not be the best place ... \"core\" may be too general (it\u0027s not as \"core\" as SkColorSpace) ... there\u0027s a reasonably strong case for \"effects\".\n\nOr maybe it gets its own \"hdr\" path.\n\nIt also may be that we eventually move `SkGainmapInfo` to `SkHdrMetadata::GainmapInfo`.\n\nFor now, I\u0027d want to keep it in \"private\" until the right solution reveals itself.",
