      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure if https://www.w3.org/TR/png-3/#cLLI-chunk would be helpful to link or just redundant. (It\u0027s how I verified we are supposed to have 2 floats of data here).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 25,
