      "message": "Just to make sure I\u0027m reading the png spec right, they only list 12 bytes for RGB and then 4 bytes for white. So, we\u0027ll be reading 2 bytes for each of those X and Y components? And we store them as floats after we convert them from PNG\u0027s integers + divsiors?",
