      "message": "Yes.\n\nIn the \"here\u0027s your HDR metadata bundle\" structure that I add next, I may keep that data in its original encoded form (I\u0027m definitely going to be doing that for ST 2094-50, cause it\u0027s much more involved), and only turn it into floats when they\u0027ll be needed by the tone mapping shader.",
